# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The workflow is as follows:\n"
"1. Specify a circuit and observable\n"
"2. Compute exact expectation values using Qiskit's statevector simulator\n"
"3. Compute noisy, unmitigated expectation values\n"
"4. Learn the noise of the entangling layers with ``qiskit-noise-learning``\n"
"5. Prepare a ZNE program with probabilistic error amplification and sample circuits of varying noise scales\n"
"6. Extrapolate to the zero-noise limit\n"
"7. Compare the mitigated expectation values\n"
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerjanya adalah seperti berikut:\n"
"1. Tentukan litar dan observable\n"
"2. Kira nilai jangkaan tepat menggunakan simulator statevector Qiskit\n"
"3. Kira nilai jangkaan berhingar yang tidak dikurangkan\n"
"4. Pelajari hingar lapisan berbelit dengan ``qiskit-noise-learning``\n"
"5. Sediakan program ZNE dengan penguatan ralat probabilistik dan litar sampel pada skala hingar yang berbeza\n"
"6. Ekstrapolasi ke had hingar sifar\n"
"7. Bandingkan nilai jangkaan yang dikurangkan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a circuit and observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Tentukan litar dan observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide you will calculate the site-averaged magnetization $\\langle Z \\rangle_{\\text{avg}} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\langle Z_i \\rangle$ of a Trotterized transverse-field Ising model (TFIM) on eight qubits in a ring topology. You will sweep several values of the strength of the transverse field and plot the magnetization as a function of the field strength. In a ring topology on an even number of qubits, the two-qubit gate layers can be split into two unique layers, as the red and green colors show in the coupling map below. Designing circuits to have a minimal set of unique entangling layers is important if you want to learn a noise model, because the unique layers must be learned independently. If you have too many unique layers in your circuit, noise learning can become infeasible due to the sampling cost of learning many layers.\n"
msgstr "Dalam panduan ini anda akan mengira magnetisasi purata-tapak $\\langle Z \\rangle_{\\text{avg}} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\langle Z_i \\rangle$ bagi model Ising medan melintang (TFIM) Trotter pada lapan qubit dalam topologi cincin. Anda akan menyapu beberapa nilai kekuatan medan melintang dan memplot magnetisasi sebagai fungsi kekuatan medan. Dalam topologi cincin pada bilangan qubit genap, lapisan gate dua qubit boleh dibahagikan kepada dua lapisan unik, seperti yang ditunjukkan oleh warna merah dan hijau dalam peta gandingan di bawah. Mereka bentuk litar supaya mempunyai set minimum lapisan berbelit unik adalah penting jika anda ingin mempelajari model hingar, kerana lapisan unik mesti dipelajari secara bebas. Jika litar anda mempunyai terlalu banyak lapisan unik, pembelajaran hingar boleh menjadi tidak praktikal disebabkan kos pensampelan untuk mempelajari banyak lapisan.\n"

